Package: bevis
Title: Client for a Bevis Host of Auditable Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Nate", "Duncan", email = "nathan.duncan@freezingpointllc.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs a query where you already run queries and submits the result
    as evidence to a Bevis host, which versions it and checks the claims
    written over it. Also wraps the host's other agent operations.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0)
Suggests:
    DBI
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
